      <h1 class="welcome__title" data-enter style="--i:1">One book<span class="welcome__turn">at a time</span></h1>
      <p class="welcome__lede" data-enter style="--i:2">A Baptist church that has been working its way through the Bible since 1841 and is currently about a third of the way into Romans. Two services on a Sunday, and coffee that is better than it used to be.</p>
      <p data-enter style="--i:3"><a class="btn" href="visit.html">Coming for the first time <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-arrow-right"/></svg></a></p>
