      </picture>
      <div class="facing__say">
        <p class="facing__role">Pastor since 2017</p>
        <h2 class="facing__name">Dan Isibor</h2>
        <p>I preach through a book because it stops me only preaching on what I find interesting, and because a congregation that has been through Romans together has something in common that a congregation of good individual talks does not.</p>
        <p>I am not hard to get hold of. If you have a question you would rather not ask in front of anybody, email is fine and so is turning up on Tuesday morning.</p>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="beliefs.html">What we believe</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="setting setting--tint2" data-reveal>
    <div class="court">
      <div class="setting__head"><h2>Three ways in</h2><p>Most people arrive by one of these rather than by walking into a Sunday cold.</p></div>
      <div class="courses">
        <div class="course">
          <span class="course__numeral" aria-hidden="true">I</span>
          <h3 class="course__name">A Sunday morning</h3>
          <p>Half past ten, about ninety minutes, coffee at both ends. Songs, a reading, and a sermon of around thirty-five minutes — which is longer than you may be used to and is the point of the place.</p>
          <a class="course__more" href="visit.html">What it is like <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-arrow-right"/></svg></a>
        </div>
        <div class="course">
          <span class="course__numeral" aria-hidden="true">II</span>
          <h3 class="course__name">A group</h3>
          <p>Eight groups meeting in houses across the town, most of them on a Wednesday. Ten or twelve people, a passage, coffee, and the sort of conversation that is difficult in a room of two hundred.</p>
          <a class="course__more" href="groups.html">Where they meet <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-arrow-right"/></svg></a>
        </div>
        <div class="course">
          <span class="course__numeral" aria-hidden="true">III</span>
          <h3 class="course__name">The prayer meeting</h3>
          <p>Wednesday at a quarter to eight. The least polished thing we do and the one most members would say they would miss most. Nobody is asked to pray aloud.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

